WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.565
This is Spectra version two, a computer
vision studio that runs in your browser.

00:00:05.665 --> 00:00:09.435
Objects mode tracks each
detected box with an ID.

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:13.402
Body draws a skeleton from
thirty-three pose landmarks.

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:17.667
In Hands, a pinch of thumb and
index finger paints with light.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:21.985
The inputs are the app's own demo
photos, panned as short clips.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:29.242
New in version two: Face fits a mesh of four hundred
seventy-eight points and scores smile, jaw and brows.

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:32.306
Segment cuts the person out of the background.

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:36.482
Gestures names the hand shape
it sees, here an open palm.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:40.499
Fusion runs the pose, hand
and face models together.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.326
Effects are drawn from the model output.

00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:45.532
Plasma arcs between fingertips.

00:00:45.933 --> 00:00:48.167
Hologram is built from the cutout.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.578
Aura glows around the body.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.391
The Lab charts measured latency and
switches a model between CPU and GPU.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.653
Its benchmark measures twenty seconds per run.

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:03.368
The video skips the wait
and shows the real result.

00:01:03.933 --> 00:01:06.210
The same studio fits a phone screen.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.718
Everything runs in your browser.

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:10.391
Nothing is uploaded.

00:01:10.967 --> 00:01:12.604
The link is on screen.
